{"id":41730,"ord":135,"n_segments":144,"prev":41729,"next":41731,"doc":{"id":"52031","title":"52031_Kenny Clarke oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Kenny Clarke","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/52031/","url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=52031"},"chapter":"Faith, Paris life and later years","title":"Scandinavia untouched by colonialism","category":"race_society","summary":"Clarke says the Scandinavian countries, never having colonies, deal with Black people straightforwardly, unlike Holland, Belgium or France.","period":null,"year_from":null,"year_to":null,"words":178,"start":[271,7],"end":[272,17],"url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=52031#s41730","tags":{"places":[{"name":"Scandinavia","focus":1,"type":"region"},{"name":"Copenhagen","focus":1,"type":"city","in":"Denmark"},{"name":"Holland","focus":0,"type":"country"},{"name":"Belgium","focus":0,"type":"country"},{"name":"Brussels","focus":0,"type":"city","in":"Belgium"},{"name":"Indonesia","focus":0,"type":"country"},{"name":"Surinam","focus":0,"type":"country"},{"name":"Congo","focus":0,"type":"country"}],"venues":[],"bands":[]},"people":[{"name":"Ben Webster","qid":"Q438460","n":1}],"story":{"theme":39,"theme_name":"Going abroad: American jazz musicians touring and living in Europe","community":79,"community_name":"Going abroad: touring Europe and Japan","core":false},"blocks":[{"p":271,"b":7,"s":"MS.","x":"Well, listen, then, now Ben lived in Copenhagen, didn't he?"},{"p":271,"b":8,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"Uh-huh. Uh-huh."},{"p":271,"b":9,"s":"MS.","x":"And Stuff lived in Belgium. Didn't he, Brussels, or --"},{"p":271,"b":10,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"No, Stuff lived in Copenhagen."},{"p":271,"b":11,"s":"MS.","x":"Oh, did he, too?"},{"p":271,"b":12,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"Yeah, uh-huh."},{"p":271,"b":13,"s":"MS.","x":"Well, so is it -- it's the -- it hasn't been contaminated?"},{"p":271,"b":14,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"No. Well, Holland has. There have been colonists. You know, Holland, they were in Indonesia."},{"p":271,"b":15,"s":"MS.","x":"Yeah."},{"p":271,"b":16,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"In Surinam."},{"p":271,"b":17,"s":"MS.","x":"Yeah. Well, Belgium did too, I guess."},{"p":271,"b":18,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"And the Belgians were in the Congo."},{"p":271,"b":19,"s":"MS.","x":"Yeah."},{"p":271,"b":20,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"And see, those countries --"},{"p":272,"b":0,"s":"MS.","x":"So -- but the Scandinavian countries --"},{"p":272,"b":1,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"No, the Scandinavian countries never had any colonies and never anything to do with all that."},{"p":272,"b":2,"s":"MS.","x":"No."},{"p":272,"b":3,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"So they're kind of --"},{"p":272,"b":4,"s":"MS.","x":"Yeah."},{"p":272,"b":5,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"-- clean thinking, you know."},{"p":272,"b":6,"s":"MS.","x":"Yeah."},{"p":272,"b":7,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"They have no --"},{"p":272,"b":8,"s":"MS.","x":"Right."},{"p":272,"b":9,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"-- like afterthoughts, like you say arriere pensees, in French, you know."},{"p":272,"b":10,"s":"MS.","x":"Yeah, right."},{"p":272,"b":11,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"When they say something, that's the way it is."},{"p":272,"b":12,"s":"MS.","x":"Yeah."},{"p":272,"b":13,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"Instead of thinking, 'Well, wait a minute. He's black. I have to figure this out.'"},{"p":272,"b":14,"s":"MS.","x":"Yes. Yes, that's right."},{"p":272,"b":15,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"But when they say something, that's it."},{"p":272,"b":16,"s":"MS.","x":"That's it."},{"p":272,"b":17,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"You know."}]}